    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        DiSE: A <span class="search-hit mathjax">diffusion</span> probabilistic <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> for automatic structure elucidation of organic compounds
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+H">Haochen Chen</a>, 
      
